{"speciesId":254,"names":{"fr":"Jungko","es":"Sceptile","en":"Sceptile","ja":"ジュカイン"},"descriptions":[{"language":"en","version":"ruby","text":"The leaves growing on SCEPTILE’s body are very sharp edged. This POKéMON is very agile - it leaps all over the branches of trees and jumps on its foe from above or behind."},{"language":"en","version":"sapphire","text":"SCEPTILE has seeds growing on its back. They are said to be bursting with nutrients that revitalize trees. This POKéMON raises the trees in a forest with loving care."},{"language":"en","version":"emerald","text":"In the jungle, its power is without equal. This POKéMON carefully grows trees and plants. It regulates its body temperature by basking in sunlight."},{"language":"en","version":"firered","text":"The leaves on its forelegs are as sharp as swords. It agilely leaps about the branches of trees to strike."},{"language":"en","version":"leafgreen","text":"The leaves on its forelegs are as sharp as swords. It agilely leaps about the branches of trees to strike."},{"language":"en","version":"diamond","text":"The leaves that grow on its arms can slice down thick trees. It is without peer in jungle combat."},{"language":"en","version":"pearl","text":"The leaves that grow on its arms can slice down thick trees. It is without peer in jungle combat."},{"language":"en","version":"platinum","text":"The leaves that grow on its arms can slice down thick trees. It is without peer in jungle combat."},{"language":"en","version":"heartgold","text":"It agilely leaps about the jungle and uses the sharp leaves on its arms to strike its prey."},{"language":"en","version":"soulsilver","text":"It agilely leaps about the jungle and uses the sharp leaves on its arms to strike its prey."},{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"Les feuilles sur ses bras peuvent trancher des troncs épais. C’est le meilleur combattant des jungles."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"The leaves that grow on its arms can slice down thick trees. It is without peer in jungle combat."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"Les feuilles sur ses bras peuvent trancher des troncs épais. C’est le meilleur combattant des jungles."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"The leaves that grow on its arms can slice down thick trees. It is without peer in jungle combat."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"The leaves that grow on its arms can slice down thick trees. It is without peer in jungle combat."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"The leaves that grow on its arms can slice down thick trees. It is without peer in jungle combat."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Les feuilles sur ses bras peuvent trancher des troncs épais. C’est le meilleur combattant des jungles."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Las hojas de sus brazos pueden cortar gruesos árboles. Invencible en los combates en la jungla."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"The leaves that grow on its arms can slice down thick trees. It is without peer in jungle combat."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"腕に 生えた 葉っぱは 大木も スッパリ 切り倒す 切れ味。 密林の 戦いでは 無敵。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Il parcourt la jungle avec agilité et attaque ses proies grâce aux feuilles tranchantes sur ses bras."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Corre con elegancia de un lugar a otro de la selva y usa las afiladas hojas de sus brazos para cazar."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"It agilely leaps about the jungle and uses the sharp leaves on its arms to strike its prey."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"ジャングルを 身軽に 走り回り 腕に 生えた 切れ味 鋭い 葉っぱで 獲物を しとめるのだ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Les feuilles qui poussent sur le corps de Jungko sont extrêmement tranchantes. Ce Pokémon est très agile. Il bondit de branche en branche avant de sauter sur son ennemi."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Las hojas que le salen a Sceptile del cuerpo tienen unos bordes muy afilados. Este Pokémon es muy ágil, va saltando de rama en rama y se lanza sobre el enemigo por la espalda."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"The leaves growing on Sceptile’s body are very sharp edged. This Pokémon is very agile—it leaps all over the branches of trees and jumps on its foe from above or behind."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"体に 生えた 葉っぱは 鋭い 切れ味。 素早い 身のこなしで 木の 枝を 飛び回り 敵の 頭上や 背後から 襲いかかるぞ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Jungko a des graines qui lui poussent sur le dos. On dit qu’elles regorgent de nutriments qui revitalisent les arbres. Ce Pokémon s’occupe des forêts avec amour."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"A Sceptile le crecen en la espalda unas semillas llenas de nutrientes que sirven para revitalizar los árboles. De hecho, se dedica a cuidarlos con mimo para que crezcan bien."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Sceptile has seeds growing on its back. They are said to be bursting with nutrients that revitalize trees. This Pokémon raises the trees in a forest with loving care."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"背中の タネには 樹木を 元気にする 栄養が 沢山 詰まっていると いわれる。 森の 木を 大事に 育てている ポケモン。"}],"varieties":[{"id":254,"moves":[{"name":"pound","learns":[[5,"level-up",1],[6,"level-up",1],[7,"level-up",1],[8,"level-up",1],[9,"level-up",1],[10,"level-up",1],[11,"level-up",1],[12,"level-up",1],[13,"level-up",1],[14,"level-up",1],[15,"level-up",1],[16,"level-up",1],[17,"level-up",1],[18,"level-up",1],[20,"level-up",1],[23,"level-up",1],[25,"level-up",1]]},{"name":"mega-punch","learns":[[6,"tutor",0],[7,"tutor",0],[20,"machine",0]]},{"name":"thunder-punch","learns":[[6,"tutor",0],[9,"tutor",0],[10,"tutor",0],[14,"tutor",0],[16,"tutor",0],[18,"tutor",0],[20,"machine",0],[25,"machine",0],[32,"train",0]]},{"name":"swords-dance","learns":[[6,"tutor",0],[7,"tutor",0],[8,"machine",0],[9,"machine",0],[10,"machine",0],[11,"machine",0],[14,"machine",0],[15,"machine",0],[16,"machine",0],[17,"machi